# AeroSpace Keybindings Cheatsheet

## Focus Navigation
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `alt+j` | Focus left |
| `alt+k` | Focus down |
| `alt+l` | Focus up |
| `alt+;` | Focus right |

## Move Windows
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `alt+shift+j` | Move window left |
| `alt+shift+k` | Move window down |
| `alt+shift+l` | Move window up |
| `alt+shift+;` | Move window right |

## Resize
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `alt+shift+i` | Shrink window (-150) |
| `alt+shift+o` | Expand window (+150) |

## Workspaces
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `alt+1-9` | Switch to workspace 1-9 |
| `alt+shift+cmd+n` | Next workspace |
| `alt+shift+cmd+p` | Previous workspace |
| `alt+shift+1-9` | Move window to workspace 1-9 |

## Layout
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `alt+shift+/` | Cycle tiles layout |
| `alt+shift+,` | Cycle accordion layout |

## Apps
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `alt+g` | Open Ghostty |
| `alt+t` | Open Thorium |

## Service Mode (`cmd+shift+alt+r`)
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `esc` | Reload config & exit mode |
| `r` | Flatten workspace tree (reset layout) |
| `f` | Toggle floating/tiling |
| `backspace` | Close all windows but current |
| `alt+j/k/l/;` | Join with window in direction |
